From 67a0f08ca937825acbfc0bb35e20d01bdc5993a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:55:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] test(ui): remove size and colour clauses from behaviour
 tests (#1990)

Move size, alignment, and non-wrapping assertions out of fixtures_page
and gcode_viewer into page_layout. Expose G-code cursor selection,
Properties pane Role::Pane, and tool icon alt text through AccessKit
so UI behaviour tests assert labels, roles, and painted textures
instead of pixel geometry or fill colours. Replace fixed pointer park
points in edge_click_modifiers and geo_row_hover with chrome_point.
